Hello,

I am using v.1.9.9.1. My data contains several DArT files with SNPs. I've merged genlight objects via gl.join; however, the resulted file does not have @position slot. Thus, I cannot produce a fasta file with gl2fasta:
Fatal Error: Data must include position information for each loci in the @position slot.

Any thoughts on how to resolve this issue? Separate genlight objects do have @position slots.

Best,
Evgenii

From u592079bda2cb3220 at groups.google.com  Mon Feb 14 23:18:21 2022
